---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const updated = "February 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Furum Consulting"
  description="How Furum Consulting collects, uses, and protects personal data."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how Furum Consulting (&ldquo;we&rdquo;,
          &ldquo;us&rdquo;, &ldquo;our&rdquo;) collects, uses, and protects
          information when you use our website or engage our services. By using
          our website, you agree to the practices described here.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, and any details you share when booking a call or contacting us.</li>
          <li>Business information relevant to delivering our services to you.</li>
          <li>Basic technical and usage data collected automatically when you visit our website, such as your browser type, device, and pages viewed.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to enquiries and provide our services.</li>
          <li>To operate, maintain, and improve our website.</li>
          <li>To communicate with you about your engagement with us.</li>
          <li>To meet our legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data we process on behalf of clients</h2>
        <p>
          When delivering outbound campaigns, we process business contact data.
          We source this data from reputable, compliant providers and process it
          in line with applicable data-protection law for the markets in which we
          operate. We retain it only for as long as needed to deliver the service,
          and we act on legitimate data-subject requests without undue delay.
        </p>

        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We may share it with trusted
          service providers who help us operate our business (for example, email,
          hosting, scheduling, and analytics providers), and only under agreements
          that require them to protect it and use it solely on our behalf.
        </p>

        <h2>Data security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect the
          information we hold against loss, misuse, and unauthorised access. No
          method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we work to
          safeguard your data appropriately.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you may have the right to access, correct,
          or delete your personal data, or to object to or restrict certain
          processing. To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the
          details below and we will respond in line with applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy question or request, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:contact@furumconsulting.com">contact@furumconsulting.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
